#: ../../tools/hocomoco_tools.rst:32 6411fb02b9e746079fe8c795f3579f53
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed information about a specific HOCOMOCO "
"transcription factor binding motif. Returns gene names, UniProt IDs, TF "
"classification, quality metrics, consensus sequence, and optionally the "
"position weight matrix (PWM). Quality grades: A (best), B, C, D (lowest)."
" Data sources: P (ChIP-Seq peaks), S (HT-SELEX). Example: "
"'P53.H14CORE.0.P.B' returns TP53 motif details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hocomoco_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/hocomoco_tools.rst:68
#: a648038b537d423fa6c83397a7aeb4b3 c4c1864d607f4bda834664dfe39639d7
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hocomoco_tools.rst:36 a2e5175756c947a19d29758295a3b08d
msgid ""
"``motif_id`` (string) (required) HOCOMOCO motif identifier. Format: "
"GENE.COLLECTION.SUBTYPE.SOURCE.QUALITY. Examples: 'P53.H14CORE.0.P.B', "
"'CTCF.H14CORE.0.P.B', 'STAT3.H14CORE.0.P.B'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hocomoco_tools.rst:39 3dc210c5b303425d94b12c1c654adc76
msgid ""
"``include_pwm`` (boolean) (optional) Whether to include the position "
"weight matrix (PWM) in the response. Default: false."
msgstr ""

